OL,3,GNEWSAGate proposed for alleyway used by
OL,4,Adrug users
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn alleyway used by drug-users and
OL,7,Ffly-tippers could be closed off to the
OL,8,Fgeneral public.
OL,10,FThe path runs between Clarence Road and
OL,11,Fa council-owned car park on Gladstone
OL,12,FStreet in Peterborough.
OL,14,FResidents have repeatedly raised
OL,15,Fconcerns over several years about
OL,16,Fincidents in the alleyway, according to
OL,17,Fa council report, with problems also
OL,18,Fincluding criminal damage, noise,
OL,19,Fsuspected thefts and fires.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
