OL,3,GNEWSAGate proposed for alleyway used by
OL,4,Adrug users
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city council has proposed the
OL,7,Finstallation of lockable gates at the
OL,8,Falleyway's entrances, restricting
OL,9,Faccess to landowners, tenants, the
OL,10,Fcouncil and the emergency services. A
OL,11,Fconsultation on the proposal will run
OL,12,Funtil 22 November.
